    <string name="onboard_title_1">Find your things by signal</string>
    <string name="onboard_body_1">blep turns your phone into a warm/cold pointer that walks you to a lost Bluetooth device — and watches for unwanted trackers travelling with you.</string>
    <string name="onboard_title_2">Hold it to your chest</string>
    <string name="onboard_body_2">Your body blocks the signal from behind, making it directional. Hold the phone flat to your chest and turn slowly — blep gets warmer toward what you're looking for.</string>
    <string name="onboard_title_3">Private by design</string>
    <string name="onboard_body_3">Everything runs on your device — no accounts, no ads, no analytics. Nothing ever leaves your phone. blep just needs Bluetooth to find devices and watch for trackers.</string>
